  "releaseNotes": "Count the broker landing's figures live and fit its parts index to six parts\nMove the admin from Blazor to Razor Pages at the repository root\nMove a client's balance one at a time, show it in the chat, keep money to six decimals\nLet the admin open the whole site's AI conversations, and count them on a client\nKeep an AI conversation to the person who held it, and give staff a page for it\nLet a catalogue page carry what each program plugs into\nCharge every AI generation, and say what it paid for\nCall the balance the balance, and let it be corrected by hand\nTell a payer what happened to their payment\nTake a conversation's fields as arguments, not as an object\nSend an older installer a catalogue it can read\nAnswer a visitor on a public page, and help them write an order\nSay what the compiler is warning about instead of building through it\nUpdated Ecng.IO.Compression to 1.0.54.\nUpdated Ecng.Linq to 1.0.193.\nUpdated Ecng.Markdown to 1.0.17.\nUpdated Ecng.Net.Clients to 1.0.378.",
